## Original Content
US AI companies cut prices as competition in large models intensifies

## Summary
US artificial intelligence companies are decreasing prices for their large models due to intensified competition in the market. This trend could make AI technologies more accessible and reflect strategic adjustments in the industry.

## Key Points
- Competition among US AI companies is intensifying.
- Large AI models are experiencing price cuts.
- This may lead to broader adoption and deployment of AI technologies.
- The focus on large models underscores their importance in current AI development.


